- "email" is a string that matches this format as a whole: one or more lowercase letters or digits, optionally followed by a single '.' or '_' and one or more lowercase letters or digits, then '@', then one or more word characters (letters, digits or underscore), then '.', then exactly 2 or 3 word characters.

